{"id": "EUVD-2026-102481", "enisaUuid": "20f33610-060e-3241-84cf-a9d3eccc92ac", "description": "RedAmon through 7.0.1 contains an unauthenticated server-side request forgery vulnerability in the agent POST /tradecraft/verify endpoint because validate_url checks only the initial hostname. Attackers can submit a public URL that redirects or DNS-rebinds to internal addresses like cloud metadata services, receiving fetched content through the model-generated summary.", "datePublished": "2026-10-15T21:43:31", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-16T18:02:23", "baseScore": 6.9, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:N/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:N/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@hieuPenguinnn/redamon-tradecraft-verify-unauth-ssrf", "https://github.com/samugit83/redamon/blob/e1dfdff671b7e76d3a002eeba37b01d92cb949e1/agentic/orchestrator_helpers/tradecraft_lookup.py#L231", "https://github.com/samugit83/redamon/blob/e1dfdff671b7e76d3a002eeba37b01d92cb949e1/agentic/orchestrator_helpers/tradecraft_lookup.py#L539", "https://github.com/samugit83/redamon/blob/e1dfdff671b7e76d3a002eeba37b01d92cb949e1/agentic/api.py#L1688", "https://github.com/samugit83/redamon", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/redamon-through-7.0.1-unauthenticated-ssrf-via-tradecraft-verify-endpoint"], "aliases": ["GHSA-g3vp-47q6-cfx3", "CVE-2026-111323"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "d17055f2-d252-3239-be50-e4494a60df96", "product": {"name": "RedAmon", "vendor": {"name": "samugit83"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22647.0.1"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "21768b13-4b59-330b-a143-25d698ed6f1f", "vendor": {"name": "samugit83"}}], "isExploited": false}